    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n71673" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξόᾰν-ον</span></b> , τό<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ʽξέὠ</span>
